  "content": "\n\n<p><em>这是一个 Fabric 模组。如需 Forge 版本，请访问&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-ping-display/\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>这里。</strong></a>&nbsp;</em>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>一个在玩家列表中显示每位玩家延迟（Ping）数值的模组，并提供多种配置选项。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HTrH0i2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"234\" height=\"94\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>这是一个客户端模组。服务器无需安装它。即使在原版服务器上也能使用。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>配置</strong></span></p>\n<p>请参阅&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/vladmarica/better-ping-display-fabric#configuration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/vladmarica/better-ping-display-fabric#configuration</a>以了解各项配置选项的具体用途。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
